{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25616806",
      "title": "Preparing the Project Pages",
      "sourceHash": "e2c764a81520ad36ace4ef1673ce2bdc485ae45baaace73708931fade0d17fd6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.33,
          "end": 3.28,
          "en": "Now to dive in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.28,
          "end": 6.8,
          "en": "I want to start with a couple of pages here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.8,
          "end": 9.97,
          "en": "And for this year, I also got my terminal open.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.97,
          "end": 13.22,
          "en": "First of all, we need to install all dependencies though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.22,
          "end": 18.16,
          "en": "with npm install and then we can use npm run dev.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.16,
          "end": 20.48,
          "en": "And then we'll start the development server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.48,
          "end": 23.41,
          "en": "but of course at the moment I got no pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.41,
          "end": 25.48,
          "en": "And hence we should add some pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.48,
          "end": 28.89,
          "en": "And for this demo application for this project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.89,
          "end": 32.87,
          "en": "which we're building here, we will need three pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.87,
          "end": 37.03,
          "en": "A starting page, which shows a list of all meetups.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.03,
          "end": 38.89,
          "en": "Then the new meet up page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.89,
          "end": 42.02,
          "en": "which allows us to add a new meetup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.02,
          "end": 44.29,
          "en": "And then the meetup detail page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.29,
          "end": 49.07,
          "en": "which allows us to show the details for a selected meetup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.07,
          "end": 51.15,
          "en": "And hence here in the pages folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.15,
          "end": 55.25,
          "en": "I'll start with the starting page with index.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.25,
          "end": 57.45,
          "en": "directly in the pages folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.45,
          "end": 61.05,
          "en": "because you learned that index is this special file name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.05,
          "end": 64.21,
          "en": "which will be loaded for just slash nothing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.21,
          "end": 66.14,
          "en": "in the given sub-folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.14,
          "end": 68.49,
          "en": "And here we're not in a sub-folder at all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.49,
          "end": 73.18299999999999,
          "en": "so index.js will be loaded for our-domain.com slash nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.03,
          "end": 75.67,
          "en": "But then we got more pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.67,
          "end": 79.02,
          "en": "For example, a page for adding a new meetup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.02,
          "end": 82.41,
          "en": "And hence we could add a new meetup.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.41,
          "end": 87.41,
          "en": "which then would be loaded for our domain slash new meetup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.92,
          "end": 90.78999999999999,
          "en": "And you did learn over the last minutes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.78999999999999,
          "end": 93.27000000000001,
          "en": "that we also have an alternative here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.27000000000001,
          "end": 95.74000000000001,
          "en": "We could also create a new meetup folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.74000000000001,
          "end": 98.75999999999999,
          "en": "instead of the file, move the file in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.75999999999999,
          "end": 101.66,
          "en": "and then rename it to index.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.66,
          "end": 105.1,
          "en": "And that would then be loaded in exactly the same way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.1,
          "end": 107.32,
          "en": "It's up to you which approach you prefer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.32,
          "end": 112.32,
          "en": "you need that sub-folder approach if you need nested routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.32,
          "end": 115.28999999999999,
          "en": "but we will not have any nested routes here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.28999999999999,
          "end": 118.08,
          "en": "so in this case, it's really up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.08,
          "end": 121.09,
          "en": "And I will go for this sub-folder approach here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.09,
          "end": 123.24,
          "en": "But again, it's your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.24,
          "end": 126.61,
          "en": "And then we also need this detail page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.61,
          "end": 129.63,
          "en": "which we load if a specific meetup was clicked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.63,
          "end": 132.93,
          "en": "and we want to view the details of that meetup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.93,
          "end": 135.38,
          "en": "And for this, we need a dynamic page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.38,
          "end": 137.7,
          "en": "because of course we'll have multiple meetups",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.7,
          "end": 142.67000000000002,
          "en": "with different IDs and DID should be part of the URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.67000000000002,
          "end": 145.97,
          "en": "and then when we load the page we want to use that ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.97,
          "end": 149.81,
          "en": "to fetch and to display the appropriate data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.81,
          "end": 151.7,
          "en": "And we also learned how this worked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.7,
          "end": 155,
          "en": "We can create a dynamic page with square brackets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 155,
          "end": 156.8,
          "en": "and then dot JS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.8,
          "end": 160.55,
          "en": "and then simply use any identifier name of our choice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.55,
          "end": 162.053,
          "en": "between the square brackets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.99,
          "end": 165.52,
          "en": "For example, meetup ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165.52,
          "end": 168.84,
          "en": "And here we could also use the sub-folder approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.84,
          "end": 172.07,
          "en": "It also is available for dynamic pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.07,
          "end": 175.24,
          "en": "We could also create a folder named meetup ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 175.24,
          "end": 176.8,
          "en": "between square brackets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 176.8,
          "end": 181.21,
          "en": "and move that file in there and then it index.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 181.21,
          "end": 182.53,
          "en": "And that also works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.53,
          "end": 184.77,
          "en": "That's something we haven't seen before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.77,
          "end": 186.99,
          "en": "and that's why I'm showing it to you here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 186.99,
          "end": 190.21,
          "en": "because it is always important to be aware of the fact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 190.21,
          "end": 194.05,
          "en": "that you can also have dynamic folder names here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.05,
          "end": 197.88,
          "en": "and then create dynamic nested pages if you need them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 197.88,
          "end": 202.41,
          "en": "Or, like in this case, one single dynamic page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 202.41,
          "end": 205.04,
          "en": "And the width that we got the page structure we want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.04,
          "end": 207.34,
          "en": "with those three pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 207.34,
          "end": 211.13,
          "en": "And hence we can now get started working on those pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 211.13,
          "end": 214.1,
          "en": "We can fill those components with some live,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 214.1,
          "end": 217.51,
          "en": "and then also step-by-step at data fetching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 217.51,
          "end": 220.423,
          "en": "and learn how NextJS helps us with that.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}